  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "81ddd7cddc178d1d",
      "translationZh": "Grok Build 中的 Agent Dashboard | SpaceXAI",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "88a3bbaa841ca07f",
      "translationZh": "Grok Build 中的 Agent Dashboard",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5ff57a67393abb9",
      "translationZh": "同时管理多个编程会话。查看每个会话正在做什么，回复需要你介入的会话，并分派新任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "874b0b16384d2ea4",
      "translationZh": "Agent Dashboard 将所有 Grok Build 会话集中在一个屏幕上。查看每个会话正在做什么，让它们并行运行，并仅在需要输入时介入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03f2e92a22bed8a9",
      "translationZh": "在 shell 中运行 grok dashboard，或在任意会话中运行 /dashboard（Ctrl+\\）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "27adeb17aee19220",
      "translationZh": "智能体 3 ⋅ 2 个工作中 │ ◇ 1 个空闲 │ [+ 新建智能体]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9efe5b8337fb3f0f",
      "translationZh": "为公共 API 添加速率限制 · main · 自动批准",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "edc433c945527fe0",
      "translationZh": "排查时好时坏的结账测试 · main · 自动批准",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ffd9796f6f1d804",
      "translationZh": "正在运行：cargo test --workspace",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb5c755ac5714e9e",
      "translationZh": "会话 019e7f5f · main · 自动批准",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9573566a8759ac6",
      "translationZh": "❯ 派发一个新会话…",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f95e883473187c0",
      "translationZh": "↑/↓ : 导航 │ Enter : 创建 │ Tab : 列表 │ Ctrl+. : 快捷键",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2a5be5492200eaa1",
      "translationZh": "一眼掌握所有会话",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d830bd91328d4e06",
      "translationZh": "仪表板按状态对会话排序，将所有等待输入的会话置顶，让你优先处理阻塞事项，其余会话则继续运行。快速扫一眼，就能了解每个会话正在做什么、已经持续了多久，无需打开任何会话也能掌握全局。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebb823080fb392e5",
      "translationZh": "工作分散在多个代码仓库中？使用 Ctrl+S 按工作目录分组。子代理归集在启动它们的会话下，因此列表展示的是你派发的工作，而不是其下展开的各个分支。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c18cf8c8c8b38cb1",
      "translationZh": "选择一行，即可在不离开仪表板的情况下查看该会话的最新输出，并直接在那里回复。空闲会话会立即发送你的消息；活跃会话则会将消息排队，直到当前轮次结束。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ee6e3bde4305056",
      "translationZh": "当会话请求批准或提出问题时，选项会直接显示在当前位置。使用方向键或数字键作答以继续。包含多个部分的问题会逐一呈现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4ecae1fc3d32e2a",
      "translationZh": "智能体 3 ◆ 1 个等待中 │ ⋅ 1 个工作中 │ ◇ 1 个空闲 │ [+ 新建智能体]",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2483ec03f3f2313",
      "translationZh": "▸ 限流器应将计数器存储在哪里？请选择一项（或选择“其他”以输入自己的答案）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9dd7c20b5b60d5eb",
      "translationZh": "▸ 1 . Redis，滑动窗口",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "519a1ee660d7207e",
      "translationZh": "2 . 内存中，每个实例独立存储",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59012a945cc5f215",
      "translationZh": "5 . 其他（输入自己的答案）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa6e12c1946fb9ab",
      "translationZh": "↑/↓ : 选择 │ Enter : 作答 │ Esc : 返回 │ Ctrl+. : 快捷键",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "817049e98c7f7afd",
      "translationZh": "分派新会话",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3bf340cb10db8b30",
      "translationZh": "底部的输入框用于启动新会话。按 Enter 即可派发任务，并停留在仪表盘；按 Shift+Enter 则会派发任务并立即打开该会话。发送前，可以设置模型、选择以计划模式启动，或允许会话自行批准其编辑操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5be6c95346ddb130",
      "translationZh": "接管任意会话",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8fa52ed9bfcd662d",
      "translationZh": "打开任意会话，即可接管其完整对话。无需返回列表，就能切换到下一个或上一个会话，完成后再回到仪表盘。关闭仪表盘后，所有会话仍会继续运行；重新打开时，它们也都还在。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a5baaa4a1e47b7c",
      "translationZh": "Agent Dashboard 随 Grok Build 一同提供。只需一条命令即可安装，然后运行 grok dashboard，或在任何已打开的会话中运行 /dashboard。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
